'use strict';

// Every form an agent can type that prints many or all environment variables, as STRINGS for the
// checkers (the keyed policy in hook-tool-policy and the keyless seatbelt mapper). Nothing here is
// ever run: the tests only feed these strings to the checkers. `stop` groups must stop in both
// modes; `pass` rows are friction rows that must stay as they were; `outOfReach` rows are script
// files whose contents dump the environment, which a pre-action check cannot see (it never scans
// file contents).

